date-released: 2026-09-16
version: "1.5"
url: "https://github.com/Hwzw/algebra-number-theory-drafts/tree/main/papers/P47-sobolev-variation"
abstract: "Sharp all-order Hilbert total variation bounds via spherical rearrangement, with a measure-endpoint theorem and full local continuation to exponents near two, and the complete all-order measure-endpoint symmetry and extremizer classification, with an explicit fourth-order constant. Also proves all-order midpoint symmetry and height-extremizer uniqueness for every finite exponent. Also proves the full variation statement on an order-dependent interval immediately above p=1. AI-assisted preprint, not independently verified."
